        <mxCell id="wa8k-ijvhR43trfy-hur-30" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Design Decision&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Should you have a database where you save each order (BL) for its Buyer Real Name.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Pro: You don&#39;t know how many API requests BL allows you to make.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Con: Managing this can get really complex and may need users beeing able to be in control and manipulate what BL order has which status.&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="WIyWlLk6GJQsqaUBKTNV-1">
